<title>UK: Ex-dividends to take 1.312 pts off FTSE on Jan 27.</title>
<headline>Ex-dividends to take 1.312 pts off FTSE on Jan 27.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following FTSE 100 stocks will trade ex-dividend on Monday January 27, FTSE International said, taking 1.312 points off the FTSE 100 index.</p>
<p>							DIVIDEND	INDEX</p>
<p>							(PENCE)	 EFFECT</p>
<p>		  COMPANY			  Net   Gross    Gross</p>
<p>  * Associated British Foods     5.25  6.56     0.344</p>
<p>  * Burton Group Plc		1.65  2.06     0.174</p>
<p>  * Scottish Power Plc	     6.17  7.71     0.528</p>
<p>  * Tomkins Plc		     3.06  3.83     0.266</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4027</p>
